Value NAME ([\w/.-]+)
Value ADMIN (Enabled|Disabled)
Value LINK (Up|Down)
Value MTU (\d+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\w+)
Value MAC ([0-9A-Fa-f:]{17})

Start
  # One multi-line block per physical interface; Record on the address line
  # (last field in the block). Values set earlier in the block persist until
  # Record clears them for the next block.
  ^Physical\s+interface:\s+${NAME},\s+${ADMIN},.*Physical\s+link\s+is\s+${LINK}
  ^Link-level\s+type:.*MTU:\s+${MTU},\s+Speed:\s+${SPEED},\s+Duplex:\s+${DUPLEX}
  ^Current\s+address:\s+${MAC} -> Record
